---
name: pipeline
description: Drive a tracker task through the full development lifecycle to an approved <!-- include: vocab/noun -->. Use when the user provides a task link or id and asks to run the pipeline, or types /pipeline. Covers admission, briefing, isolated implementation, independent tests, deterministic gates, independent verification, opening the <!-- include: vocab/noun -->, and monitoring reviewer remarks until approval.
